OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FMillions of people across England and
OL,7,FWales have received an emergency alert
OL,8,Fon their phones amid the ongoing
OL,9,Fwildfires sweeping parts of the UK.
OL,11,FThe alert, issued on a rolling basis
OL,12,Ffrom 7pm on Friday, warned against
OL,13,Flighting anything that could spark a
OL,14,Fwildfire, including barbecues,
OL,15,Fcampfires, and fireworks, the Cabinet
OL,16,FOffice said.
OL,18,FIt read: "There is a very high risk of
OL,19,Fwildfires nationally.
OL,26,@zD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
