PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,F"Residents, landowners and visitors
OL,7,Fshould not undertake any activity that
OL,8,Fcould start a fire, including
OL,9,Fdisposable barbecues, firepits, garden
OL,10,Fincinerators or fireworks.
OL,12,F"Even a small flame can rapidly
OL,13,Fdevelop into a major wildfire placing
OL,14,Flives, homes, businesses and emergency
OL,15,Fresponders at risk.
OL,17,F"Follow official updates and report
OL,18,Fsigns of fire immediately by calling
OL,19,F999."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU{D@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
