PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FIt comes after the government
OL,7,Fannounced a ban on disposable
OL,8,Fbarbecues and the prime minister
OL,9,Fwarned smokers not to risk setting
OL,10,Flight to "tinderbox" Britain as he
OL,11,Fscrambled to respond to the summer
OL,12,Fheatwave and wildfires.
OL,14,FThe alert follows the outbreak of
OL,15,Fseveral major blazes, including a
OL,16,Fwildfire in Stourbridge, in the West
OL,17,FMidlands, where 19 homes were
OL,18,Fcompletely destroyed.
OL,26,@rD@JOUrD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
