OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham urged
OL,7,Fpeople to "take the emergency alert
OL,8,Fseriously", adding: "Our priority now
OL,9,Fis to keep everyone safe and prevent
OL,10,Fmore fires from starting."
OL,12,FLouise Haigh, the First Secretary of
OL,13,FState, said Friday's message was "the
OL,14,Fmost extensive use of the UK's
OL,15,Femergency alert system in response to
OL,16,Fan active incident".
OL,18,FWhat is an emergency alert?
OL,26,@oD@KOUpD@JO]pD@UOUrD@ZO]uD@bOUxD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
