PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FYou may get an alert on your device
OL,7,Fabout "any type of life-threatening
OL,8,Femergency", such as wildfires, severe
OL,9,Fflooding and extreme storms, the
OL,10,Fgovernment said.
OL,12,FWhen this happens, your mobile phone
OL,13,For tablet might make a loud siren-like
OL,14,Fsound, vibrate, or read out an alert.
OL,15,FThis can happen even if your phone is
OL,16,Fon silent, and will last about ten
OL,17,Fseconds.
OL,19,FWho sends emergency alerts?
OL,26,@oD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
