PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FAlerts on your phone can only be sent
OL,7,Fvia the emergency services, government
OL,8,Fdepartments, or agencies and public
OL,9,Fbodies that deal with emergencies.
OL,11,FOrganisations do not need to know your
OL,12,Fphone number to send an alert.
OL,14,FWhat do I need to do if I get an alert?
OL,16,FThe government advises that you should
OL,17,Fstop what you are doing and follow the
OL,18,Finstructions in the alert. Alerts
OL,19,Finclude a link to see more information
OL,20,Fon the government website.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
