PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FIf you are driving, you should not
OL,7,Fread or respond to an alert.
OL,9,F"If there's nowhere safe and legal to
OL,10,Fstop, and nobody else is in the
OL,11,Fvehicle to read the alert, you can
OL,12,Flisten to news on live radio to find
OL,13,Fout about the emergency," it said.
OL,15,F"If you have a vision or hearing
OL,16,Fimpairment, audio and vibration
OL,17,Fattention signals will let you know
OL,18,Fyou have an emergency alert if
OL,19,Faccessibility notifications have been
OL,20,Fenabled on your mobile phone or
OL,21,Ftablet."
OL,26,@qD@AOUwD@AOU}D@HO]
