OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FEarlier on Friday, Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham visited Stourbridge - one of
OL,8,Fthe worst affected areas - to meet
OL,9,Fthose affected by wildfire damage and
OL,10,Fthank firefighters for their work.
OL,12,FHe said the country has to "face up"
OL,13,Fto the "changing climate" and needs to
OL,14,Ftransition to "more clean energy".
OL,16,FBurnham said plans were being drawn up
OL,17,Ffor emergency financial support for
OL,18,Ffire services battling the spread of
OL,19,Fwildfires.
OL,26,@tD@\OUtD@dO]uD@HOUuD@YO]vD@OOUvD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
