PN,31409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FAmid the wildfires raging across the
OL,7,Fcountry, the government appointed
OL,8,FBaroness Blake of Leeds as fire
OL,9,Fminister, serving in the Ministry of
OL,10,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,11,FGovernment.
OL,13,FBurnham told broadcasters: "I've never
OL,14,Fseen scenes like this in Britain,
OL,15,Fwhere you just see a whole house
OL,16,Fgutted, smouldering."
OL,18,FThe prime minister said 100 military
OL,19,Fpersonnel had been deployed to a blaze
OL,20,Fin South Wales to offer "critically
OL,21,Fneeded" support.
OL,26,@uD@\OUxD@UO]|D@YOU}D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
