OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FHe said "Britain is a tinderbox right
OL,7,Fnow" with "37 fires smouldering around
OL,8,Fthe country".
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FA heat health alert was extended until
OL,16,FSaturday for much of England amid
OL,17,Fwarnings that high temperatures may
OL,18,Fincrease health risks for vulnerable
OL,19,Fgroups.
OL,26,@nD@IOUoD@DO]oD@KOUpD@LO]
