CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786781886
OL,3,CWildfire emergency alert sent to
OL,4,Cmillions of phones - what does it mean?
OL,6,FThe UKHSA has warned high temperatures
OL,7,F"may increase health risks,
OL,8,Fparticularly for vulnerable groups".
OL,10,FWith record dry conditions in July and
OL,11,Fa dry start to August, nearly three-
OL,12,Fquarters of England and the whole of
OL,13,FWales are in drought, heaping pressure
OL,14,Fon water resources for households,
OL,15,Fagriculture and the environment.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@cO]
